          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa el método correcto para imprimir todas las variables de entorno disponibles.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(os.environ)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>os</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y finalmente <code>environ</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa el diccionario del entorno para leer <code>API_KEY</code> y luego imprime todas las variables de entorno disponibles.</p><p>Guarda el diccionario en <code>variables</code>. Imprime primero el valor de la clave y después el diccionario completo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"environ\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"variables[&quot;API_KEY&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>os</code> seguido de <code>environ</code>, <code>\"API_KEY\"</code> y finalmente <code>variables</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asegúrate de establecer un valor predeterminado en caso de que el diccionario <code>os.environ</code> no contenga el que estamos buscando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>get</code> seguido de <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> y luego <code>,</code>, <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Establece un valor predeterminado por si el diccionario <code>os.environ</code> no contiene la clave que necesitas.</p><p>Recupera <code>NON_EXISTENT_KEY</code> de forma segura para que el programa muestre <code>default_value</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"os.getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"set\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;missing&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>os.environ</code> seguido de <code>get</code>, <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> y finalmente <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
